Subject: [PATCH] base-files: add a uci-defaults function for the PSE default

Add ucidef_set_network_device_pse, which gives netifd's pse option of a
port a default in board.json: whether netifd switches PSE (PoE) on for
the port. netifd reads it as a JSON boolean, unlike the strings that the
other network_device functions write.

---
diff --git a/package/base-files/files/lib/functions/uci-defaults.sh b/package/base-files/files/lib/functions/uci-defaults.sh
index 34005fe0fa..7fd53cfc8e 100644
--- a/package/base-files/files/lib/functions/uci-defaults.sh
+++ b/package/base-files/files/lib/functions/uci-defaults.sh
@@ -135,6 +135,15 @@ ucidef_set_network_device_conduit() {
 	_ucidef_set_network_device_common $1 conduit $2
 }
 
+# netifd reads the default as a JSON boolean
+ucidef_set_network_device_pse() {
+	json_select_object "network_device"
+	json_select_object "${1}"
+	json_add_boolean pse "${2}"
+	json_select ..
+	json_select ..
+}
+
 _ucidef_add_switch_port() {
